        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty said about Moab:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Curse those who do not do the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s work with all their heart! Curse those who do not slash and kill!)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Moab has always lived secure and has never been taken into exile. Moab is like wine left to settle undisturbed and never poured from jar to jar. Its flavour has never been ruined, and it tastes as good as ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“So now, the time is coming when I will send people to pour Moab out like wine. They will empty its wine jars and break them in pieces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Moabites will be disillusioned with their god Chemosh, just as the Israelites were disillusioned with Bethel, a god in whom they trusted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Judgement has come on the cities of the plateau: on Holon, Jahzah, Mephaath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dibon, Nebo, Beth Diblathaim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiriathaim, Bethgamul, Bethmeon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerioth, and Bozrah. Judgement has come on all the cities of Moab, far and near. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab's might has been crushed; its power has been destroyed. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Make Moab drunk, because it has rebelled against me. Moab will roll in its own vomit, and people will laugh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab, remember how you jeered at the people of Israel? You treated them as though they had been caught with a gang of robbers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You people who live in Moab, leave your towns! Go and live on the cliffs! Be like the dove that makes its nest in the sides of a ravine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab is very proud! I have heard how proud, arrogant, and conceited the people are, how much they think of themselves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", know of their arrogance. Their boasts amount to nothing, and the things they do will not last. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so I will weep for everyone in Moab and for the people of Kir Heres. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will cry for the people of Sibmah, even more than for the people of Jazer. City of Sibmah, you are like a vine whose branches reach across the Dead Sea and go as far as Jazer. But now your summer fruits and your grapes have been destroyed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Happiness and joy have been taken away from the fertile land of Moab. I have made the wine stop flowing from the winepresses; there is no one to make the wine and shout for joy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The people of Heshbon and Elealeh cry out,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48.34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heshbon",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cry out",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and their cry can be heard as far as Jahaz; it can be heard by the people in Zoar, and it is heard as far as Horonaim and Eglath Shelishiyah. Even the brook of Nimrim has dried up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will stop the people of Moab from making burnt offerings at their places of worship and from offering sacrifices to their gods. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“So my heart mourns for Moab and for the people of Kir Heres, like someone playing a funeral song on a flute, because everything they owned is gone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All of them have shaved their heads and cut off their beards. They have all made gashes on their hands, and everyone is wearing sackcloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On all the housetops of Moab and in all its public squares there is nothing but mourning, because I have broken Moab like a jar that no one wants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab has been shattered! Cry out! Moab has been disgraced. It is in ruins, and all the surrounding nations jeer at it. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has promised that a nation will swoop down on Moab like an eagle with its outspread wings, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the towns and fortresses will be captured. On that day Moab's soldiers will be as frightened as a woman in labour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab will be destroyed and will no longer be a nation, because it rebelled against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Terror, pits, and traps are waiting for the people of Moab. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever tries to escape the terror will fall into the pits, and whoever climbs out of the pits will be caught in the traps, because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has set the time for Moab's destruction. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helpless refugees try to find protection in Heshbon, the city that King Sihon once ruled, but it is in flames.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48.45",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heshbon, the city",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "flames",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the city of Heshbon, but it is in flames and the palace of King Sihon is burning.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Fire has burnt up the frontiers and the mountain heights of the war-loving people of Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pity the people of Moab! The people who worshipped Chemosh have been destroyed, and their sons and daughters have been taken away as prisoners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
